<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Le Moyne d&apos;Iberville returns two weeks after his first visit, on the day of his infectious diseases consultation with Dr. Okonkwo-Hale. He has had no fever, chills or sweats since then. The intake blood smears and rapid antigen test were negative, and the PCR sent to the reference laboratory at intake has detected Plasmodium vivax DNA. His quantitative G6PD activity is normal. He is not on any medicine and has no allergies. He is keen to be treated before the squadron&apos;s preparations take up all his time. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fever</td><td>None since intake</td></tr><tr><td>Results</td><td>Smears and rapid antigen test negative; PCR detected P. vivax DNA; G6PD normal</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

