    <td>Relapsing Plasmodium vivax malaria: P. vivax DNA detected by PCR in blood drawn between attacks, with negative smears and rapid antigen test; after three relapses treated without antirelapse therapy; normal quantitative G6PD</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
